==History==
2023
*The Warmth [[Cards|card]] was made available in the Snowstorm event on 11/12/2023.
*On 18/12/2023, the Warmth was removed from the game.
2024
*On 9/12/2024, the Warmth was readded to the game in the Snowstorm event.
*On 16/12/2024, the Warmth was removed from the game.

==Trivia==
*The Warmth, along with [[Skeletons]], [[Electro Spirit]], [[Fire Spirit]], [[Ice Spirit]], [[Heal Spirit]], and [[Heal]], are the cheapest [[cards]], costing 1 [[Elixir]]. Also, along with the Heal, the Warmth is the cheapest [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]] card.

